1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,880
Oh Lord, how many of my foes, many are rising against me.

2
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:20,480
Mercy of my soul, there is no salvation for him in God.

3
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:25,360
There is no salvation in God.

4
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:38,160
But you, oh Lord, are a shield above me, my glory and the lifter of my head.

5
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:51,440
I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me from his holy hill.

6
00:00:51,440 --> 00:01:03,280
I lay down and slept, I woke again for the Lord sustained me.

7
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:20,480
I will not be afraid of many thousands, people who have set themselves against me.

8
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:50,480
I will not be afraid of many thousands, people who have set themselves against me.

9
00:01:50,480 --> 00:02:05,520
But you, oh Lord, are a shield above me, my glory and the lifter of my head.

10
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:17,520
I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me from his holy hill.

11
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:34,000
Salvation belongs to the Lord, may your blessing be on your people.
